                                    "id": "117",
                                    "verticalAlign": false,
                                    "body": {
                                        "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Higher Education</span></p>\n<h1>City College of San Francisco</h1>\n<p>Creating a unified digital experience for the university meant eliminating fragmented systems and establishing a single source of truth. By integrating course data directly into the website, we streamlined content management, improved accuracy, and made it easier for students and faculty to access up-to-date information. The result is a cohesive, user-friendly platform that brings clarity and consistency to the university’s academic offerings.</p>\n<p><a class=\"button transparent\" href=\"https://www.ccsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"0\">View Website</a></p>\n"
                                    }
                                }
