                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"h3\">Outcome</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">Delivered a modern, user-focused university website experience that improved access to academic and campus information while creating a flexible foundation for future enhancements. The project strengthened the institution’s digital presence through better integrations, improved usability, and scalable architecture.</p>\n"
